ystems unlock new opportunities and expand the world.\u00a0The wasteland is filled with useful creatures, some friendlier than others. Collect, farm and maintain the wasteland inhabitants to help you cleanse the world. Not all organisms are created equally useful.   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TREASURE TROVE OF LOOT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/3a1bdda58a6bdca79398784c5b89eda5.poster.avif?t=1756894559\" width=620 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/3a1bdda58a6bdca79398784c5b89eda5.webm?t=1756894559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/3a1bdda58a6bdca79398784c5b89eda5.mp4?t=1756894559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\ud83c\udf81<strong>Wasteland full of collectibles</strong>. Items you find in the wasteland are unique with different physical aspects and use cases. You find random junk, and rare finds to turn into collections. Curate <strong>mixtapes</strong> and <strong>trade</strong> items <strong>with</strong> the &quot;Lost &amp; Found&quot;<strong> shops</strong> for valuable rewards. As you progress, your Scrapbook becomes a vast inventory of different collectable sets. Pro tip: Pencils, sawblades, basketballs and glass bottles are best as bullets. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INSPIRATIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcad </strong>A love letter to <strong>Nausica\u00e4 of the Valley of the Wind</strong>, <strong>The Legend of Zelda: Wind Waker</strong> with <strong>eco-punk storytelling</strong> and Solarpunk aesthetics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/336acdd9890292a4acf1a46ba0d653f7.poster.avif?t=1756894559\" width=620 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/336acdd9890292a4acf1a46ba0d653f7.webm?t=1756894559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/336acdd9890292a4acf1a46ba0d653f7.mp4?t=1756894559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Kluk Digital"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/f86863bb6375cd75f4b8d7518d7f739235af5b99/header.jpg?t=1756894559","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"The \"Wasteland Waste Disposal\" & \"Windpunk\" related copyrights and trademarks are held by the developer or its affiliates unless otherwise stated. Any unauthorized use or reproduction of content may violate copyright laws and can be subject to legal action","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> </li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> </li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> </li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> </li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"i